# REFALL AB workbench

The workbench stores subject context, coverage records, evidence, capability decisions, and reports.
Each subject has a separate workbench.
The ledger preserves observations and decisions across agent sessions.

## Operation

1. Create a subject workbench.
2. Set the source path.
3. Generate the shared context.
4. Examine the scope and launch capability.
5. Start the research loop.
6. Examine findings and pending actions.
7. Prepare the report.
8. Resolve closeout conditions.
